<view class="page"><view class="page-masthead"><image class="masthead-icon" src="/assets/icons/recycle.png"/><view class="masthead-copy"><view class="page-title">预约上门回收</view><view class="masthead-subtitle">分类回收，绿色生活</view></view></view><view class="card muted">服务免费；服务员称重后按小区标准发放环保积分。回收类别、单价和合作企业由小区配置。</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">选择回收类别</view><view class="choices"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="code" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="category" class="ui-button {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}">{{item.name}}</button></view><textarea maxlength="200" placeholder="补充说明（选填）" bindinput="note" value="{{note}}"/><view wx:if="{{slots.length}}" class="field"><text class="label">预约时段</text><picker range="{{slots}}" range-key="start" value="{{slotIndex}}" bindchange="selectSlot"><view class="picker">{{slots[slotIndex].date}} {{slots[slotIndex].start}}–{{slots[slotIndex].end}}</view></picker></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="ui-button" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading || busy}}">重新加载</button></view><button class="ui-button" type="primary" bindtap="create" disabled="{{busy || loading || quoting || !pricing}}" loading="{{busy}}">提交免费预约</button></view><privacy-popup/>
